    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description><![CDATA[## What is xleak?

A fast terminal Excel viewer with an interactive TUI. Features full-text search, formula display, lazy loading for large files, clipboard support, and export to CSV/JSON. Built with Rust and ratatui.
]]></description>
    <summary>A fast terminal Excel viewer with an interactive TUI. Features full-text search, formula display, lazy loading for large files, clipboard support, and export to CSV/JSON. Built with Rust and ratatui</summary>
